  "title": "ieee80211: Dissect ANQP Neighbor Report per IEEE 802.11-2020",
  "description": "IEEE 802.11-2020 in 9.4.5.19 Neighbor Report ANQP-element deleted\nthe line found in previous versions that \"The Element ID and the\nLength fields of the Neighbor Report element, as shown in Figure\n8-215, are not included.\"\n\nCf. IEEE 802.11-2020 9.4.5.19, p. 1422 with IEEE 802.11-2016\n9.4.5.19, p. 1141 and IEEE 802.11-2012 8.4.4.19 p. 726.\n\nThis is to make it practical to contain \"zero or more neighbor reports\"\nas always promised; using the overall length of the ANQP-element\nmade it impossible to distinguish between added length for a second\nNeighbor Report and additional length for optional subelements.\n\nThis flaw was, according to reports, discovered in implementation and\ninteroperability testing and the original version is not known to have\nbeen deployed in any implementation. Implement the IEEE 802.11-2020\nversion.\n\nFix #16103",
  "state": "merged",
